{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-completion.md","title":"完整一致延伸与句子编码","display":"df-completion — 完整一致延伸与句子编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-completion","aliases":["20-df-completion"],"display":"df-completion — 完整一致延伸与句子编码","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 10.1.1；§10.2（逻辑一致性与完备延伸的本地展开）","source_pdf_pages":[215,216],"source_printed_pages":[183,184],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-pa]]","[[20-df-provable]]","[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completion — 完整一致延伸与句子编码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 10.1.1；§10.2（逻辑一致性与完备延伸的本地展开）"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span><span>184</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\)</span>；固定经典 Hilbert 系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=P_H\">\\(P=P_H\\)</span>，并取逻辑矛盾句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=((0=0)\\land\\neg(0=0))\">\\(\\bot=((0=0)\\land\\neg(0=0))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8372bbf882660759\" href=\"?note=8372bbf882660759\" title=\"20-df-classical-proof-system\">20-df-classical-proof-system</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a> 在语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{PA}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{PA}\\)</span> 上已选定的语法树编码。本条固定句子枚举双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\">\\(g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\)</span> 以及数值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ [\\gamma(n)=\\kappa(g(n))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ [\\gamma(n)=\\kappa(g(n))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 是句子枚举序号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma(n)\">\\(\\gamma(n)\\)</span> 是该句子的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 语法树代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TheoryCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{TheoryCode}\\)</span> 取句子在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 中的序号；本条及下游衡量理论的计算性和度时均沿用该同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和已固定的编码参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\not\\vdash_P\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nPA\\subseteq T\\land\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n(\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\vdash_P\\theta\\Rightarrow\\theta\\in T])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[\\theta\\in T\\lor\\neg\\theta\\in T].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\not\\vdash_P\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nPA\\subseteq T\\land\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n(\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\vdash_P\\theta\\Rightarrow\\theta\\in T])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[\\theta\\in T\\lor\\neg\\theta\\in T].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TheoryCode}(T):=\\{n\\in\\omega:g(n)\\in T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TheoryCode}(T):=\\{n\\in\\omega:g(n)\\in T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10.2 在印刷第 184 页选取句子枚举双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>；本条将这个角色记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 表达其有效性。固定句子双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的代码函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 全可计算；给定有效句子代码，搜索唯一的相同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma(n)\">\\(\\gamma(n)\\)</span> 即计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g^{-1}\">\\(g^{-1}\\)</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}\">\\(\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}\\)</span> 衡量理论的计算性和度。经典逻辑中，推出这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 等价于同时推出某句及其否定，因此单参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Consistent}\">\\(\\operatorname{Consistent}\\)</span> 对任意句子理论都有标准含义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\ne S0\">\\(0\\ne S0\\)</span>，故在包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"PA\">\\(PA\\)</span> 的理论上，也可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span> 检测不一致。但若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\{0=S0\\}\">\\(T=\\{0=S0\\}\\)</span> 且没有算术公理，取单元素结构、令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为恒等函数便给一个模型；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S0\">\\(0=S0\\)</span> 当成任意理论的逻辑矛盾会误判此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。当前定义保留完整一致延伸的签名，并消除这项额外算术前提。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.1.1 与 §10.2 的完整一致延伸；证明系统和矛盾句为本地展开。印刷页 183, 184；PDF 第 215, 216 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-classical-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-classical-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\kappa$ 采用 [[20-df-formula]] 在语言 $\\mathcal L_{PA}$ 上已选定的语法树编码。本条固定句子枚举双射 $g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})$ 以及数值函数 $\\gamma\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}$，满足","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"P=P_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=((0=0)\\land\\neg(0=0))","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\omega\\to\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ [\\gamma(n)=\\kappa(g(n))].","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TheoryCode}","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow T\\not\\vdash_P\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\nPA\\subseteq T\\land\\operatorname{Consistent}(T)\\land\n(\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\vdash_P\\theta\\Rightarrow\\theta\\in T])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[\\theta\\in T\\lor\\neg\\theta\\in T].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TheoryCode}(T):=\\{n\\in\\omega:g(n)\\in T\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma(n)","display":false},{"tex":"g^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Consistent}","display":false},{"tex":"PA","display":false},{"tex":"0\\ne S0","display":false},{"tex":"PA","display":false},{"tex":"0=S0","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\{0=S0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"0=S0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":3059,"backlinks":[{"id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})$；$P=P_H$ 为上游固定的经典 Hilbert 证明系统；$T$ 作为公理集合使用。语法树编码沿用 PA 语言上已固定的参数；句子枚举 $g$、$\\operatorname{TheoryCode}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Consistent}$ 均采用 [[20-df-completion]] 中固定的接口。"},{"id":"32e788ac089e03ef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TheoryCode}$ 使用 [[20-df-completion]] 中固定的句子枚举双射 $g$ 及其有效性接口；$X(n)$ 记录 $g(n)$ 是否属于 $T$。这里的 $n$ 是枚举序号，不要求等于句子 $g(n)$ 的语法树代码。"},{"id":"63a9c41255fee3d1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal D$。$\\operatorname{TheoryCode}$ 及其句子枚举双射 $g$ 沿用 [[20-df-completion]] 中固定的参数；理论的度通过该枚举序号集合衡量，句子枚举的有效性相对于同一组已固定的语法编码解释。"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2","4e01ee20e163d443","ea674d0eb2839a85","8372bbf882660759"]}